                            <comment id="13673000" author="maysamyabandeh" created="Mon, 3 Jun 2013 10:51:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Submitting the patch to get Hudson comments.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13673108" author="robinanil" created="Mon, 3 Jun 2013 13:42:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;There is a getNumNonZeroElements() method in AbstractVector try using that.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13673114" author="robinanil" created="Mon, 3 Jun 2013 13:55:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Also I see test failures. Dont change the behavior of getNumNonDefaultElement, instead try to correct the serialization code to write the correct size.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13673140" author="maysamyabandeh" created="Mon, 3 Jun 2013 14:08:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The attached fixes the bug using AbstractVector#getNumNonZeroElements suggested by &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=robinanil&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;robinanil&quot;&gt;robinanil&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
